title: Convene the Constituent Assembly
card-image: img/cards/constitutional_reform.svg?v=2
subtitle: Bring the election forward from November.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: coalition_affairs
view-if: constitutional_reform_timer <= 0 and assembly_early = 0 and dix <= 19 and in_coalition = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; constitutional_reform_timer = 4

The Provisional Government set the Constituent Assembly elections for 12 November (New Style 25 November), and has postponed them twice. The Kadets prefer delay, the SRs and the Mensheviks want the Assembly now, and the Bolsheviks say that the Assembly is a trap.

- @bring_forward: Demand an election in the first half of October. (1 resource)
- @keep: Keep the date, and spend the time on preparations.
- @easy_discard

@bring_forward
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no resources.

How should it be carried out? Phased in, with compensation and negotiation, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. By decree it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can pass it and enforce it against them.

- @bring_forward_slow: Phase it in, with compensation and negotiation.
- @bring_forward_decree: Pass it by decree, as written.
- @bring_forward_force: Pass it by decree, and break any opposition by force.

@bring_forward_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.pay(Q, 1);
Q.assembly_early = 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -5, rel_ally: 4, soviet_democracy: 2, bolshevik: -2});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2, middle: 2, workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Demand an election in the first half of October");
!}

The Provisional Government, under pressure from the Soviet, has moved the elections to the first half of October. The Kadets protested, and voted for it. It was phased in slowly, with compensation where it was owed, and the opposition grumbled rather than raged.



@bring_forward_decree
subtitle: The law as written. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'decree', () => {
RO.pay(Q, 1);
Q.assembly_early = 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -5, rel_ally: 4, soviet_democracy: 2, bolshevik: -2});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2, middle: 2, workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Demand an election in the first half of October");
!}

The Provisional Government, under pressure from the Soviet, has moved the elections to the first half of October. The Kadets protested, and voted for it.



@bring_forward_force
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Chance of breaking its opponents: Kadets [+ odds_kad +]%. A camp under 45% is too strong to touch, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.pay(Q, 1);
Q.assembly_early = 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -5, rel_ally: 4, soviet_democracy: 2, bolshevik: -2});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2, middle: 2, workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Demand an election in the first half of October");
!}

The Provisional Government, under pressure from the Soviet, has moved the elections to the first half of October. The Kadets protested, and voted for it. [+ law_text +]

@keep
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, 0);
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 2});
!}

The elections will be held on the date already announced. We will use the time.
